WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:05.329
Danny: He’s got me!

2
00:00:05.489 --> 00:00:16.574
Brad: Danny: I can’t run!

3
00:00:17.134 --> 00:00:18.034
He’s got me!

4
00:00:18.054 --> 00:00:20.355
Tina: Well, do SOMETHING!

5
00:00:20.375 --> 00:00:26.158
Brad: Did that work?

6
00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:28.519
Tina: No.

7
00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:29.799
And now it’s got me!

8
00:00:29.839 --> 00:00:32.745
Danny: Brad, do something!

9
00:00:32.765 --> 00:00:36.868
Brad: I’m thinking.

10
00:00:42.053 --> 00:00:43.033
Think faster.

11
00:00:43.774 --> 00:00:46.056
Who knows where this creature is taking us!

12
00:00:46.076 --> 00:00:49.018
Brad: Well, it lives in the dark, right?

13
00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:52.181
Tina: It lives in a dark world, that’s for sure.

14
00:00:52.201 --> 00:00:53.482
Danny: Yeah.

15
00:00:53.882 --> 00:00:56.705
And it didn’t attack until I broke the flashlight.

16
00:00:58.786 --> 00:01:00.328
Brad: I think it’s afraid of the light!

17
00:01:01.508 --> 00:01:03.870
Tina: I wish you hadn’t broken that flashlight, Danny.

18
00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:05.611
Danny: Me too!

19
00:01:05.651 --> 00:01:09.093
Brad: So just make another flashlight!

20
00:01:09.113 --> 00:01:13.797
Danny: I’ve got a better idea.

21
00:01:14.377 --> 00:01:16.138
This monster scared us.

22
00:01:16.679 --> 00:01:18.320
It’s time to scare him.

23
00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:20.421
Brad: What are those?

24
00:01:20.662 --> 00:01:23.103
Danny: Just you wait.

25
00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:35.456
Tina: Fireworks!

26
00:01:35.476 --> 00:01:36.597
Danny, that’s brilliant!

27
00:01:43.859 --> 00:01:45.740
Ha-ha! Brad: I was right.

28
00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.541
Light is its enemy!

29
00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:49.742
Nice work, Danny.

30
00:01:50.162 --> 00:01:54.204
Danny: I’ve got just one more.

31
00:01:54.224 --> 00:02:00.726
Tina: It sure is pretty.

32
00:02:00.746 --> 00:02:02.647
Brad: Hey.

33
00:02:02.907 --> 00:02:04.948
There’s more than just silver and gold here.

34
00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:06.865
Brad: There are diamonds too.

35
00:02:06.885 --> 00:02:12.187
Brad: You know what’s cool?

36
00:02:12.207 --> 00:02:13.628
Tina: What?

37
00:02:13.648 --> 00:02:15.948
Brad: Come down here and look.

38
00:02:16.349 --> 00:02:17.149
You too, Danny.

39
00:02:21.771 --> 00:02:22.511
Do you see them?

40
00:02:22.531 --> 00:02:23.992
Tina: See what?

41
00:02:24.012 --> 00:02:26.053
Brad: Look at the rainbows.

42
00:02:26.073 --> 00:02:28.634
Danny: A rainbow!

43
00:02:28.654 --> 00:02:33.056
Brad: Yes, you can see all the colors of a rainbow when you.

44
00:02:35.468 --> 00:02:38.009
Tina: Danny Danny: That’s it!

45
00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:39.490
Tina: What’s it?

46
00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:41.431
Danny: What Brad said!

47
00:02:41.451 --> 00:02:43.072
Brad: What did I say?

48
00:02:43.112 --> 00:02:47.154
Danny: I’ve figured out how we get to Ginormous!

49
00:02:47.174 --> 00:02:50.436
Tina: Danny, you’re going to have to explain!

50
00:02:50.456 --> 00:02:54.138
Danny: All these worlds have been about color.

51
00:02:54.158 --> 00:02:58.401
Danny: And our mission is to bring color back to Hopian’s world.

52
00:02:58.421 --> 00:03:03.643
Danny: But not just one color, all the colors─like a rainbow!
